
---
const steps = [
  {
    title: 'Discover',
    description:
      "We start with a conversation about your business, your goals and what you want your website to achieve. I'll help establish the right approach for your project.",
  },
  {
    title: 'Design & Build',
    description:
      "I'll bring your ideas to life, designing and developing a professional website that reflects your business, works across devices and delivers what your customers need.",
  },
  {
    title: 'Review & Refine',
    description:
      "You'll have the opportunity to review your website, share feedback and request changes. We'll work together to make sure everything is looking and working as expected.",
  },
  {
    title: 'Launch & Support',
    description:
      "Once you're happy, we'll arrange the final payment and get your website live. I'll also help you choose the right care plan to keep everything secure, maintained and running smoothly.",
  },
];
---

<section id="process" aria-labelledby="pr">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2 id="pr">How it works</h2>
    <p>
      Getting your business online shouldn't be complicated.
      My straightforward four-step process keeps you involved
      from the initial conversation right through to launch and beyond.
    </p>
  </div>

  <ol class="steps">
    {steps.map((step) => (
      <li>
        <b>{step.title}</b>
        <span>{step.description}</span>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>
</section>
